%%label I. Ouverture: Grave – Vivace – Grave
%%note D major. A French overture: a dotted Grave (repeated), a four-voice fugue, and a short return of the Grave.
X:1
T:Bach’s Missing Symphony
T:I. Ouverture: Grave – Vivace – Grave
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of J. S. Bach
M:4/4
L:1/8
Q:"Grave" 1/4=60
%%score [tpt1 tpt2] timp [ob1 ob2 bn] [v1 v2 va vc cb] hpd
% Original AI-composed homage. The score is written at sounding pitch.
V:tpt1 clef=treble name="Tpt. I"
V:tpt2 clef=treble name="Tpt. II"
V:timp clef=bass name="Timp."
V:ob1 clef=treble name="Ob. I"
